## Gates

The shared [WyattAu engineering standards](https://github.com/WyattAu/engineering-standards)
Node gate matrix — install, typecheck, lint, build, test — runs automatically
on every push (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`). Keep your `bun.lock` committed so
installs stay reproducible.

| Gate | Command |
|------|---------|
| typecheck | `bun run typecheck` |
| lint | `bun run lint` |
| build | `bun run build` |
| test | `bun run test` |

